Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.82,0:00:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,太陡了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.07,0:00:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.08,0:00:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,秀秀智能轮椅
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.46,0:00:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,新品上市
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.79,0:00:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,过台阶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.93,0:00:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,走窄路
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.95,0:00:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,一个人也能轻松出门
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.75,0:00:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你都到了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.12,0:00:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,给谁做
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.75,0:00:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,给我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.03,0:00:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你看这颜色
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.40,0:00:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这个好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.77,0:00:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,老板
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.51,0:00:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你这儿怎么进去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.22,0:00:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,旁边有个坡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.28,0:00:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这坡我上不了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.75,0:01:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,秀秀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.67,0:01:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这条消息你发的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.74,0:01:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才进店时发的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.74,0:01:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,她的轮椅上不来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.55,0:01:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,得把台阶写上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.32,0:01:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,别让人白跑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.77,0:01:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.43,0:01:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我改
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.53,0:01:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这两处可以报给街道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.43,0:01:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,附上照片
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.58,0:01:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,要报吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.23,0:01:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,都报吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.46,0:01:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,看看能不能修
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.39,0:01:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这两根柱子挪一下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.74,0:01:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,去车站就不用绕了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.04,0:02:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这回行了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.62,0:02:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,让她也试试
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.01,0:02:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这里转不过来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.92,0:02:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这袖子好看
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.42,0:02:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,转过去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.16,0:02:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我看看后面
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.19,0:00:20.03,Time,,0,0,0,,几天后
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.98,0:01:45.33,Time,,0,0,0,,数周后
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.36,0:01:52.40,Time,,0,0,0,,此后数月
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.52,0:02:12.28,Time,,0,0,0,,几天后
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.11,0:02:36.46,Time,,0,0,0,,两年后的春天
